# No Tests

Do not write, add, or update tests for this project.

- Do not create `*.test.ts`, `*.test.tsx`, `*.spec.ts`, or `*.spec.tsx` files
- Do not add test cases to existing test files
- Do not suggest adding tests unless the user explicitly asks

Existing tests may remain; do not expand test coverage unless explicitly requested.
